            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1217934?u=be46df35c141149e2121fe65b01d9a665608e4bc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">With the latest KDE upgrades, <code class=\"notranslate\">lxqt-config-monitor</code> stopped working, unable to find the KScreen dbus and systemd services.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-text-shell-session notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"$ lxqt-config-monitor \norg.kde.kscreen: Failed to request backend: &quot;org.freedesktop.DBus.Error.ServiceUnknown&quot; : &quot;The name org.kde.KScreen was not provided by any .service files&quot;\nConnecting to KScreen...\nError: Config is invalid, probably backend couldn't load\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">$ <span class=\"pl-s1\">lxqt-config-monitor </span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">org.kde.kscreen: Failed to request backend: \"org.freedesktop.DBus.Error.ServiceUnknown\" : \"The name org.kde.KScreen was not provided by any .service files\"</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">Connecting to KScreen...</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">Error: Config is invalid, probably backend couldn't load</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #427595.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3254347010\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/427595\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/427595/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/427595\">#427595</a></p>\n\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> x86_64-darwin</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">Package tests</a> at <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a> for functions and \"core\" functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\